KNOWN GAPS: (1) game still draws separate balls, NOT the smooth blended surface (the raymarcher is not ported into the game's three.js renderer; decide: raymarch layer vs marching-cubes mesh). (2) holes/cuts, tubes (neck), links and rotation are ignored by the game. (3) organ curves (digestiveCurve etc.) are fixed in game coordinates and do not follow body edits. (4) muzzle disappears from the game after the first applied edit (editor model has none). (5) srcdoc iframe + localStorage on file:// in Safari untested; the postMessage path does not depend on it for the editor->game direction. (6) safe-area padding inside the iframe untested.
